{"id":"calidad","lemma":"calidad","pos":"noun","rank":1975,"glosses":["quality (level of excellence)","kind, type"],"ipa":"/kaliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"calidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-calidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tú pagas por calidad.","en":"You pay for quality.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455392"},{"text":"La calidad es malísima.","en":"The quality is very low.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505282"},{"text":"Prefiero calidad a cantidad.","en":"I prefer quality to quantity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524812"},{"text":"¿Tienes algunos de mejor calidad?","en":"Do you have better quality ones?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587279"},{"text":"¿Es de buena calidad esta tela?","en":"Is this good material?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454217"}]}